    <div class="about-content">
      <div class="about-text">
        <h1>About AgroVision</h1>
        <p class="lead">
          We're revolutionizing agriculture through artificial intelligence and
          computer vision technology.
        </p>

        <p>
          AgroVision was founded in 2020 with a simple mission: to help farmers
          protect their crops from diseases using cutting-edge technology. Our
          team of agricultural experts, data scientists, and software engineers
          have developed an advanced CNN (Convolutional Neural Network) model
          that can accurately identify crop diseases from images.
        </p>

        <p>
          With over 95% accuracy across 50+ crop types and 5,000+ diseases, our
          platform has already helped more than 10,000 farmers worldwide save
          their crops and improve their yields.
        </p>

        <div class="mission-vision">
          <div class="mission">
            <h3><i class="fas fa-bullseye"></i> Our Mission</h3>
            <p>
              To empower farmers with accessible, accurate, and instant crop
              disease detection technology, reducing crop losses and improving
              global food security.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="vision">
            <h3><i class="fas fa-eye"></i> Our Vision</h3>
            <p>
              A world where no farmer loses their livelihood to preventable crop
              diseases, and where AI technology serves as a reliable partner in
              sustainable agriculture.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

